{
  "duration": 74.279,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.119,
      "end": 0.259,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.719,
      "end": 1.5,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 1.86,
      "end": 3.179,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.679,
      "end": 4.46,
      "text": "Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.92,
      "end": 7.879,
      "text": "a person crosses an 800-meter-long street."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.399,
      "end": 9.439,
      "text": "The time taken is"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.92,
      "end": 11.84,
      "text": "eight minutes and 20 seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.359,
      "end": 13.019,
      "text": "The question is"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.539,
      "end": 16.299,
      "text": "asking us to find his speed in kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.94,
      "end": 19.26,
      "text": "So speed equal to distance divided by time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.859,
      "end": 21.52,
      "text": "but distance is given in meter,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.1,
      "end": 24.459,
      "text": "and time is given in minutes and seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.039,
      "end": 25.699,
      "text": "So first,"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.18,
      "end": 28.539,
      "text": "we need to convert the time into seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.139,
      "end": 31.279,
      "text": "Eight minutes means eight into 60,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.939,
      "end": 33.439,
      "text": "which is 480 seconds,"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 35.599,
      "text": "and 20 seconds is already there."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.919,
      "end": 39.2,
      "text": "So total time becomes 480 plus 20 equal to"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.579,
      "end": 40.5,
      "text": "500 seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.079,
      "end": 41.36,
      "text": "Done."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.779,
      "end": 43.699,
      "text": "Now put the values in the speed formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.2,
      "end": 48.779,
      "text": "Speed equal to distance divided by time, which is 800 divided by 500."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.279,
      "end": 50.34,
      "text": "After simplifying this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.659,
      "end": 52.68,
      "text": "we get 1.6 meter per second."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.119,
      "end": 55.599,
      "text": "But the question is asking in kilometer per hour,"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.079,
      "end": 62.139,
      "text": "so we need to convert meter per second into kilometer per hour. For that, we multiply it by 3.6,"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.459,
      "end": 65.26,
      "text": "so speed becomes 1.6 into 3.6,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.659,
      "end": 68.079,
      "text": "which is 5.76 kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.459,
      "end": 74.279,
      "text": "Hence, the final answer will be 5.76 kilometer per hour, so the correct answer is option D."
    }
  ],
